OL,3,AAlmost 2,000 schools blockaded or
OL,4,Aclosed, says union, as protests take
OL,5,Aplace across France
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn Lille, bins have been set on fire,
OL,8,Freports Nick Beake - while a student in
OL,9,FParis tells Hugh Schofield: "I am very
OL,10,Fscared for the future"
OL,12,FIn the past week, students have
OL,13,Fblockaded hundreds of schools with at
OL,14,Fleast 215 injured and more than 5,000
OL,15,Fpeople arrested
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
